      "content": "To ensure your safety, immediately isolate the phone from any other devices or items and store it in a fireproof container or plastic bag to contain any potential explosion. Keep the phone away from heat sources, flammable materials, and children. Consider using a heat-resistant adhesive tape to hold the phone in place if the screen is lifting off. Do not try to purchase or dissect the battery without proper precautions, and seek professional help for disposal.",
